            "A stone of wisdom, serenity and communication, said to calm and clarify speech. Blue zircon is the modern birthstone for December. It is associated with the throat chakra and the sign of Sagittarius. Cleansing under running water; recharging in moonlight, avoiding sun and strong UV, which can dull its colour."
